        "original_id": "e5e7b5f1-2278-576f-9078-7d1210c10e01",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kid Rock, Sheryl Crow, Allison Moorer\n- Albums: Cocky\n- Songs: Picture, Lonely Road of Faith, Love Is Free\n- Companies: Atlantic, Crow's label\n\nFacts:\n- Kid Rock's 2001 album Cocky included the ballad \"Picture\" as a duet with Sheryl Crow.\n- \"Lonely Road of Faith\" was the second single released from Kid Rock's 2001 album Cocky.\n- Kid Rock re-recorded \"Picture\" for radio with Allison Moorer because Atlantic initially could not get rights from Sheryl Crow's label to release the album version as a single.\n- Sheryl Crow wrote and recorded the song \"Love Is Free.\"",
